      "sparse_rank": 8,
      "text": "Train the SingleR classifier on one or more reference datasets with known labels. ref A numeric matrix of expression values where rows are genes and columns are reference samples (individual cells or bulk samples). labels A character vector or factor of known labels for all samples in ref.",
